# Protection from red that Akroma's Memorial gives (CR 702.16) comes with state-based actions as the Memorial arrives: Bot2's
# Quicksilver Dagger (a blue and red Aura) on Bot1's Hired Blade is put into its owner's graveyard (CR 702.16c, 704.5m), and
# Bot1's own Dire Flail (red Equipment) becomes unattached and stays on the battlefield (CR 702.16c, 704.5n), so the Blade
# loses its +2/+0. Afterwards Bot2 can't target the Blade with Lightning Bolt (CR 702.16b, the refusal) and bolts Bot1 instead
# (the positive control).

